    89	[[cor-heine-borel-in-the-product-topology]] records that on $\mathbb{R}^n$ the
    90	product topology is the Euclidean one, so Heine-Borel applies unchanged.
    91	
    92	**Local compactness and the Baire property.** [[def-locally-compact-space]] asks
    93	only that every point have a compact neighbourhood, and
